-cli-cn","agent_clan_generation":"20261026131420","bead_id":"bob-cli-cn.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-cn[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Day strip typical day — a quiet reference line under each numeric [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]fact[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Under Worked, Reviewed, Done, and Created, every Day strip shows [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]one quiet line with that metric's typical day: the median of the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]seven days before D, needing at least four days with data. On [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]finished days a neutral ▲, ▼, or = mark comes first, so the line [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]reads `▼ typical 4h 10m`. Today shows `typical 4h 10m` with no [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]mark. bob computes every number and word in a new additive [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`typical` object on day-grouped JSON points, and the plugin only [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]paints it. The line has no colour, no percentages, and no bars. The[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]strip never changes height when data arrives. The decision is [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]recorded so no future agent \"fixes\" it back out.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]day_strip_typical_day.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/day_strip_typical_day.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-cn[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-cn/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob stats — additive `typical` object on day-grouped count and[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]minutes points[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]typical-field[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]typical-field: in bob-cli, add the optional `typical` object (window [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]D−7…D−1, median, ≥4 usable days, relation, words, detail) to current [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]day-grouped `points` of count and minutes metrics. Share the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]usable-value rule with rolling medians and extend the Day lead-in from 6[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to 7 days. Cover it with hand-derived unit and golden tests, document [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the schema-1 field in docs/stats.md, and check parity read-only on the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]live vault.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Day strip — paint bob's typical line under the four numeric [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]facts[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]strip-line[dim] · [dim][/dim]after typical-field[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]strip-line: in bob-plugins bob-ledger-tools, build a pure `ref` model [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]from `point.typical` and paint an aria-hidden reference line with SVG [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]▲/▼/= marks on every fact. Keep the line's space on every fact. Put [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob's words in the fact's aria-label and tooltip. Require day-grouped [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reports for cache reuse, and repaint when only the reference changes. [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Extend the unit tests and the preview harness (new states, alignment, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]clipping, contrast, measured budgets). Update the plugin docs and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-cli Day strip contract, bump the plugin version, then sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Decision record, Day Strip glossary strand, bead bob-cli-bs, [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]three-week check[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]record[dim] · [dim][/dim]after strip-line[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]record: in bob-cli, add the decisions strand for the typical-day [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]comparison and update the Day Strip glossary strand. Regenerate memory [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and docs, then close memory bead bob-cli-bs as superseded by the new [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record. Propose the three-week exit check as a follow-up for the land [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]agent to file as a snoozed task bead.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-cn","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-cn.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-2e9b00f38cb28e72edf46a02335e2ed7","started_at":"2026-10-26T17:23:45.047767+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"6011392827824399ff14ad1a271d5bc4a3bfb08f781ff8ba2fe4543db395e6c6","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-cn.3/chat.md","size_bytes":3940},"commits":{"digest":"ff88d71da2486853c464cd8ccfdc1888c3313dc0eb63f4b2fddee08033ebeefb","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-cn.3/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-cn.3/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"cf13c746630969e41191228a0f1334174b1920c9b83a20608f393ec432663e14","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-cn.3/meta.json","size_bytes":702},"prompt":{"digest":"87a5c374d72aa89ad8d77bc908a67f74a95712ed2346dcafabb9d68010e05cf3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-cn.3/prompt.md","size_by